{"ticker":{"symbol":"950140.KQ","name":"잉글우드랩","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":6120.0,"change_pct":0.0016366612111293755,"market_cap":121591341056.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.03287745098039216,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":13590.0,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","country":"United States","city":"Totowa","employees":null,"website":"https://www.englewoodlab.com","business_summary":"Englewood Lab, Inc. engages in the research, development, manufacture, and sale of cosmetic products in the United States, Korea, Canada, China, Japan, Europe, and internationally. It offers masks, cleansers, and anti-aging skincare products, as well as face, eye, and body moisturizer; primers and foundations, BB and CC Cream, concealer, blush and illuminizers, bronzer highlighter, and lip care; and over the counter products, such as SPF/ACNE, personal hygiene, and skin protectant. The company was founded in 2004 and is headquartered in Totowa, New Jersey. Englewood Lab, Inc. operates as a subsidiary of Cosmecca Korea Co., Ltd.","business_summary_ko":"Englewood Lab, Inc.는 미국, 한국, 캐나다, 중국, 일본, 유럽 및 전 세계에서 화장품 연구, 개발, 제조 및 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. 마스크, 클렌저, 노화 방지 스킨케어 제품은 물론 얼굴, 눈, 바디 모이스처라이저도 제공합니다. 프라이머 및 파운데이션, BB 및 CC 크림, 컨실러, 블러셔 및 일루미나이저, 브론저 하이라이터 및 립 케어; SPF/ACNE, 개인 위생, 피부 보호제 등 일반의약품도 포함됩니다. 이 회사는 2004년에 설립되었으며 뉴저지주 토토와에 본사를 두고 있습니다. 잉글우드랩(주)는 코스메카코리아(주)의 자회사로 운영됩니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"생활용품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":151508766000.0,"operating_income":9881552000.0,"net_income":7265416000.0,"eps":362.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":206784099000.0,"operating_income":28855109000.0,"net_income":20742431000.0,"eps":1044.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":182220439000.0,"operating_income":18795236000.0,"net_income":19627929000.0,"eps":9